{101}{}{A young woman with grease to the elbows, a pencil behind one ear and a smile that has survived several explosions. One eyebrow is growing back.}

{110}{}{Now, where did I put the acid?}
{111}{}{Note to self: label the jars.}
{112}{}{It only smoked a little this time!}
{113}{}{Hmm. That's not the color it was yesterday.}
{114}{}{Three fingers of solder, one of hope...}
{115}{}{If it's ticking, it's working. I think.}

# First meeting: 200 plus one remark about what the player is wearing (201 nothing,
# 202 leather jacket, 203 leather armor, 204 anything else).
{200}{}{Hi! Welcome to Craterside Supply! I'm Moira. I sell things, fix things and write things down. }
{201}{}{And look at you, no armor at all! That's either very brave or a very short story.}
{202}{}{Ooh, a leather jacket! Does it stop bullets, or only the slow ones?}
{203}{}{Real leather armor! May I count the stitches later? It's for science.}
{204}{}{And what an outfit! Did it come off somebody, or did you find it empty?}

# Later meetings: 210 normal, 211 bomb disarmed and she knows, 212 bomb rigged, 213 Simms dead.
{210}{}{You're back! And with all your fingers! What can I do for you?}
{211}{}{It's the bomb tamer! Ten percent off, just like I promised. What do you need?}
{212}{}{Oh, hi! Is it me, or is the bomb humming today? It never used to hum. Anyway! What can I get you?}
{213}{}{Hello. It's quiet without the sheriff, isn't it? I keep listening for the boots. What do you need?}

{214}{}{What else? Ask anything! Asking is how we find out which things explode.}

{220}{}{Let's see what you have for sale.}
{221}{}{What do you know about the bomb?}
{222}{}{I hear you're writing a book.}
{223}{}{Who's the grump at the end of your counter?}
{224}{}{I disarmed the bomb.}
{225}{}{I lost your notes on the bomb.}
{226}{}{The caravan man is dead. I have a letter going north.}
{227}{}{I'll be going.}
{228}{}{Shiny things! Trade?}
{229}{}{Big boom ball?}
{230}{}{Bye bye, happy lady.}
{231}{}{How is the book coming along?}
{232}{}{You make picture book?}
{233}{}{Cow man dead. You take paper for girl's mama?}
